          "Illustrative: next billing date and cancellation method absent."
        ]
      ],
      "formulas": [
        {
          "cell": "I5",
          "formula": "=COUNTIF(E2:H4,\"missing\")+COUNTIF(E2:H4,\"partial\")"
        },
        {
          "cell": "I6",
          "formula": "=COUNTIF(I2:I4,\">0\")"
        },
        {
          "cell": "J5",
          "formula": "=COUNTIF(J2:J4,\"N\")"
        },
        {
          "cell": "J6",
          "formula": "=COUNTA(A2:A100)"
        }
      ],
      "notes": "One row per enrollment surface and variant. Enter present, partial, or missing per attribute. Example rows are illustrative only. Verify state law locally and confirm language with qualified counsel. Column I open-issue counts are illustrative tallies, not legal conclusions."
    },
    {
      "name": "Consent-Flow Checklist",
      "columns": [
